      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Shakir: Collei's Dream",
      "content": "In Version 6.6 Collei dreamed that everyone in Sumeru City had their identities switched, a warning that later led the sages and Nahida to evacuate the rainforest to Caravan Ribat. At the council Shakir asked to talk with her, and privately asked whether she had ever had dreams so vivid they seemed real. Collei recalled one of fire from sky to ground and ashes on the wind. Shakir doubted this was coincidence, wondered about prophecy, and admitted he could not explain it since she had never studied astrology.",
