      "comment": "Shakir: Temple of Silence Misgivings",
      "content": "Inside the Temple of Silence, the sages debate using ancient technology as a substitute for the Akasha Terminal power source. Shakir notes that it was experimental even in King Deshret's day, with no knowledge of its outcome. Rushd also thinks the plan risky, while Alkindi says it is the only option and Firnas judges the risks manageable.",
